{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"227733","name":"ibis Melun","description":"يوفر الفندق 73 غرفة مزودة بخدمة الواي فاي المجانية، ومطعم La Table Rouge (مغلق مساء الجمعة، والسبت، والأحد)، وبار مع قائمة وجبات خفيفة على مدار 24 ساعة، وموقف سيارات خاص مجاني. يُعد فندق ibis Melun نقطة انطلاق مثالية للعديد من الرحلات الاستكشافية، مثل زيارة قلاع Vaux-le-Vicomte وBlandy-les-Tours وFontainebleau وغابتها الوطنية. يتميز الفندق بموقع مثالي لرحلات العمل، حيث يقع على بُعد 5 دقائق من مركز مدينة Melun و25 دقيقة من Fontainebleau.","address":"81, Avenue De Meaux","city":"MELUN","countryCode":"FR","postalCode":"77000","lat":48.550958,"lng":2.666637,"stars":3,"chain":"ACCOR","giataCode":"153032","phone":"33 892702043","email":"H0620@accor.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/22/227733/227733a_hb_a_004.jpg?20250130122134?20250624111049","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/22/227733/227733a_hb_a_005_20250312_063231.jpg?20250312073231?20250624111049","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/22/227733/227733a_hb_a_007_20251127_113702.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/22/227733/227733a_hb_a_010_20251127_113706.jpg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/22/227733/227733a_hb_a_013_20251127_113717.jpg","category":"exterior","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/22/227733/227733a_hb_a_014_20251127_113719.jpg","category":"exterior","order":5},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/22/227733/227733a_hb_a_015_20251127_113720.jpg","category":"exterior","order":6},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/22/227733/227733a_hb_a_016_20251127_113722.jpg","category":"exterior","order":7},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/22/227733/227733a_hb_a_017_20251127_113723.jpg","category":"exterior","order":8},{"url":"https://photos.ho